[5.224,"o","\r\n============================================================\r\n   SAIL-PROXY Kyma Setup\r\n============================================================\r\n\r\nThis script will help you configure the SAP LLM Gateway\r\nfor Kyma deployment, including:\r\n  - Kubernetes manifests and ConfigMaps\r\n  - Authentication providers\r\n  - Public HTTPS or internal-only deployment\r\n  - IP allowlisting with Istio AuthorizationPolicy\r\n\r\n\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mKubernetes namespace to deploy into:\u001b[22m\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\u001b[2m(sail-proxy-test) \u001b[22m\u001b[57D\u001b[57C\u001b[2K\u001b[G\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mKubernetes namespace to deploy into:\u001b[22m\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\u001b[36msail-proxy-test\u001b[39m\u001b[54D\u001b[54C\r\nKubernetes namespace: sail-proxy-test (not the default sail-proxy)\r\n   Output: kyma/deployments/sail-proxy-test\r\n   istio-system and cluster-scoped objects are prefixed \"sail-proxy-test-\"\r\n\r\n"]
[6.62,"o","🔑 Namespace sail-proxy-test does not exist yet on kube context kyma-demo (https://api.c-abc123.kyma.ondemand.com)\r\n\u001b[?25l\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mIs this the right cluster? Generate new encryption keys and database credentials for namespace \u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[1msail-proxy-test?\u001b[22m\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\u001b[2m(Use arrow keys)\u001b[22m\r\n  Yes \r\n\u001b[36m❯ No\u001b[39m \r\n  ← Back \u001b[9D\u001b[9C"]
[6.822,"o","\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[G\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mIs this the right cluster? Generate new encryption keys and database credentials for namespace \u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[1msail-proxy-test?\u001b[22m\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m❯ Yes\u001b[39m \r\n  No \r\n  ← Back \u001b[9D\u001b[9C"]
[6.907,"o","\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[G\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mIs this the right cluster? Generate new encryption keys and database credentials for namespace \u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[1msail-proxy-test?\u001b[22m\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\u001b[36mYes\u001b[39m\u001b[20D\u001b[7C\r\n\u001b[?25h   Generating new encryption keys for namespace sail-proxy-test\r\n\r\nDeployment Options:\r\n\r\n\u001b[?25l\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mSelect deployment type:\u001b[22m\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\u001b[2m(Use arrow keys)\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[36m❯ Public HTTPS - Internet accessible with IP allowlisting\u001b[39m \r\n  Internal-only - Access via Cloud Connector Service Channel \r\n  ← Back \u001b[9D\u001b[9C"]
[6.993,"o","\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[G\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mSelect deployment type:\u001b[22m\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\u001b[36mPublic HTTPS\u001b[39m\u001b[38D\u001b[38C\r\n\u001b[?25hAvailable authentication providers:\r\n\r\n\u001b[?25l\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mSelect authentication provider:\u001b[22m\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\u001b[2m(Use arrow keys)\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[36m❯ Local Development (hardcoded users) - ⚠️  WARNING: Do not use in production!\u001b[39m \r\n  GitHub OAuth \r\n  LDAP/Active Directory \r\n  Okta SAML \r\n  SAP Cloud Identity Services (OpenID Connect) \r\n  ← Back \u001b[9D\u001b[9C"]
