[10.091,"o","\u001b[2K\u001b[G\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mKyma cluster subdomain (e.g., c-abc123 from https://console.c-abc123.kyma.ondemand.com):\u001b[22m\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\u001b[36mc-abc123\u001b[39m\u001b[100D\u001b[100C\r\n\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1m⚠️  The shared Istio ingress gateway already has ALLOW policies (e.g. production's IP allowlist), so it is \u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[1mdeny-by-default:\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[1m  namespace sail-proxy-test NEEDS its own IP allowlist - enter the client IPs that should reach it - or its \u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[1mhost is refused for everyone.\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[1m  IP allowlist (comma-separated CIDRs, e.g., 203.0.113.7/24,203.0.113.12/32):\u001b[22m\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\u001b[2m() \u001b[22m\u001b[82D\u001b[82C"]
